    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Weapon (Club), Very Rare</em></p><p>This reinforced lute can be wielded as a magic Club that deals an extra 2d8 Thunder damage on a hit.</p><p><strong>Sing and Swing.</strong> If you’re a Bard, you can use your Charisma modifier instead of your Strength modifier when making a melee attack roll with the lute, provided you sing or hum while making the attack.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-dirkBTf9iur7LIx9\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Sing and Swing</em> n’apparaît qu’aux Bards : son jet d’attaque utilise le Charisme, ses dégâts gardent la Force.</p></section>",
